From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Gurov <alexander.gurov@konsulko.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Nov 2022 11:47:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] lino-imx93: Use mender_dtb_name for fdtfile.

We use preboot to unconditionally set the value of fdtfile to
mender_dtb_name.  This is more consistent with how Mender is
expected to handle DTB names when using Yocto.

Changelog: Title
Signed-off-by: Alexander Gurov <alexander.gurov@konsulko.com>
---
 configs/lino-imx93_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/lino-imx93_defconfig b/configs/lino-imx93_defconfig
--- a/configs/lino-imx93_defconfig
+++ b/configs/lino-imx93_defconfig
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT=y
 CONFIG_OF_SYSTEM_SETUP=y
 CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="bootflow scan -b"
 CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT=y
-CONFIG_PREBOOT="test -n ${fdtfile} || setenv fdtfile imx93-lino-${fdt_board}.dtb"
+CONFIG_PREBOOT="setenv fdtfile ${mender_dtb_name}"
 CONFIG_SYS_CBSIZE=2048
 CONFIG_SYS_PBSIZE=2074
 CONFIG_LOG=y
--
2.38.1

